@startuml
title Reservation, Payment, and Delivery Flow
autonumber

actor User
participant "Next.js Client" as Client
participant "Listings API (/api/listings/{id})" as ListingsAPI
participant "Payment Order Route (/api/razorpay/order)" as OrderAPI
participant "Razorpay Checkout" as Checkout
participant "Razorpay Gateway" as Razorpay
participant "Verification Route (/api/razorpay/verify)" as VerifyAPI
database "Prisma (MongoDB)" as Prisma
participant "Delivery API (/api/delivery/get)" as DeliveryAPI
actor "Delivery Partner" as Courier
participant "Delivery Dashboard" as DeliveryUI

User -> Client: Choose listing & start checkout
Client -> ListingsAPI: GET /api/listings/{id}
ListingsAPI -> Prisma: findUnique(listingId)
Prisma --> ListingsAPI: Listing details
ListingsAPI --> Client: Listing payload

Client -> OrderAPI: POST amount for Razorpay order
OrderAPI -> Razorpay: orders.create(options)
Razorpay --> OrderAPI: orderId, amount, key
OrderAPI --> Client: Order payload

Client -> Checkout: open(orderId, user details)
Checkout -> Razorpay: Process payment
Razorpay --> Checkout: payment_id, signature
Checkout --> Client: razorpay_order_id, razorpay_payment_id, signature

Client -> VerifyAPI: POST payment + reservation data
activate VerifyAPI
VerifyAPI -> VerifyAPI: Validate HMAC signature
VerifyAPI -> Prisma: address.findUnique(addressId)
Prisma --> VerifyAPI: Address details
VerifyAPI -> Prisma: reservation.create (with nested payment)
Prisma --> VerifyAPI: Reservation + Payment
VerifyAPI -> Prisma: delivery.create (reservation, address)
Prisma --> VerifyAPI: Delivery record
VerifyAPI --> Client: success(reservationId, deliveryId)
deactivate VerifyAPI

Client -> User: Show confirmation & delivery tracking link

note over Client
Reservation saved with paid status
end note

== Delivery assignment ==

Courier -> DeliveryUI: Sign in to dashboard
DeliveryUI -> DeliveryAPI: GET /api/delivery/get
DeliveryAPI -> Prisma: delivery.findMany(include reservation, address, listing)
Prisma --> DeliveryAPI: Delivery list
DeliveryAPI --> DeliveryUI: Deliveries with assignments
DeliveryUI --> Courier: Display pending deliveries

@enduml

